## COMPLETION

When done:
1. Run `cd frontend && npx vitest run` — all tests must pass
2. Run `cd C:/Next-Era/elephant-rock-platform && python -m pytest -p no:asyncio -m "not slow and not integration" -k "not trio" --tb=short -q` — all non-trio backend tests must pass
3. Write `docs/aiv/BATCH-52/REPORT-TASK-01-2026-05-02.md`
4. Write `docs/aiv/BATCH-52/REPORT-TASK-02-2026-05-02.md`
5. Write `docs/aiv/BATCH-52/EXECUTION-DONE`

